# The build context is the repository root, and the image needs four directories of it. Everything
# else is excluded by default, so a new folder at the root does not quietly end up in the image.
*
!generator/
!templates/
!tokens/
!web/api/

# Build output and tool state inside those four: Gradle's alone is gigabytes on a machine that has
# built the templates.
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
**/.cxx/
**/.idea/
**/captures/
**/__pycache__/
**/DerivedData/
**/.build/
**/xcuserdata/
**/.swiftpm/
**/kotlin-js-store/
**/node_modules/
**/*.zip
generator/tests/

# Never, under any circumstances, in an image that gets pushed somewhere.
**/local.properties
**/keystore.properties
**/keys/
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
